.\n\nReport file paths, line numbers, and the key code structures. Focus on identifying WHERE the CPU overhead comes from.\n"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01Xb4bGvtwS9Mwetygo8hVe2","session_id":"3f2fc226-1649-44e7-a922-02ccd916e4bc","uuid":"328d9569-bd1c-462e-bbf9-ed7897f4e7c4","timestamp":"2026-04-12T20:29:19.346Z"}
